# Local stack harness workflow

Load when the task touches runtime, Docker, API edges, local proofs, or stack health.

Harness lives in workspace root `scripts/` and assumes `TOP_CODE_ROOT` = workspace folder.

## When to run

| Trigger                                                | Command                                                   |
| ------------------------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------- |
| Po zmianie portow, kluczy, tokenow Node B / Daszek     | `pwsh -File scripts/sync-local-stack-env.ps1`             |
| Przed smoke lub etykieta `proven_local`                | `pwsh -File scripts/preflight-local-stack.ps1`            |
| Gmail + Daszek + mailbox/GraphStore PG                 | `pwsh -File scripts/preflight-local-stack.ps1 -FullStack` |
| Wiekszy Gate A+B                                       | `pwsh -File scripts/verify-local-gates.ps1`               |

## Closure rule

Po zmianach runtime / Docker / API / bridge agent sam wykonuje build, recreate, preflight i proof zamiast delegowac to operatorowi.

